   "announcedAt": "2017-02-20T08:46:50.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We've created the first patch to Animal Lover, fixing a few bugs we didn't know were there the first time around and a couple that we thought we fixed but I guess life has a way blindsiding you when you present yourself to the entire world but I'm getting ahead of myself, of course! Should all be taken care of! Ha ha ha ha ha!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you come across any bugs now, PLEASE let us know if you see them and report them! We want you to experience Animal Lover as it was meant to be played!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here's a few of the things we fixed",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Frankie's kiss scene no longer switches clothing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "'Learning The Hard Way' and 'Learning The Easy Way' paths now consistently separate.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ren'Py default sprite no longer showing up in that weird spot on Frankie's path",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "The diner scene's meal tracking should be fixed now.: Secondly: We have Steam Trading Cards now!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "15 Cards!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "7 Backgrounds!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "5 Emoticons!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
